<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
  html { background: #ffffff; }
  body {
    width: 720pt; height: 405pt; margin: 0; padding: 0;
    background: #FFFFFF; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  }
  .header {
    background: #2C3E50; padding: 20pt 40pt;
    height: 40pt; display: flex; align-items: center;
  }
  h1 { color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 28pt; margin: 0; }
  .content { padding: 20pt 40pt; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
  .left-col { width: 60%; }
  .right-col { width: 35%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-start; padding-top: 10pt; }

  ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 15pt; }
  li { margin-bottom: 12pt; color: #34495E; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 1.4; }
  strong { color: #E67E22; }

  .box {
    background: #F8F9F9; border: 2pt solid #BDC3C7; border-radius: 8pt;
    padding: 15pt; text-align: center;
  }
  .box h3 { margin: 0 0 5pt 0; color: #2C3E50; font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; }
  .highlight { font-size: 18pt; color: #C0392B; font-weight: bold; margin: 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1>第一篇：金融常识与底层逻辑</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <div class="left-col">
      <ul>
        <li><strong>货币的本质：</strong> 理解货币供应 (M2) 与通货膨胀的关系，看清钱袋子的缩水真相。</li>
        <li><strong>宏观经济：</strong> 掌握经济周期的运行规律，在繁荣与萧条中寻找机会。</li>
        <li><strong>核心思维：</strong>
          <ul style="margin-top: 5pt; font-size: 14pt;">
            <li>复利思维：时间是财富的朋友。</li>
            <li>风险分散：不要把鸡蛋放在一个篮子里。</li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="right-col">
      <div class="box">
        <h3>核心公式</h3>
        <p class="highlight">收益 = 本金 × (1 + 收益率)^时间</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>